                  "__component": "blocks.accordion",
                  "id": 108,
                  "title": "How do I book a service?",
                  "content": "Call 070 815 379 or send an email. Describe the problem or the service you want and we will arrange for you to drop the bike off. We do not keep fixed working hours — the slot is always arranged."
                },
                {
                  "__component": "blocks.accordion",
                  "id": 109,
                  "title": "Which bikes do you service?",
                  "content": "All of them: city, road, gravel, mountain and e-bikes. We have the most experience with mountain bikes, but we treat every other type just as carefully."
                },
                {
                  "__component": "blocks.accordion",
                  "id": 110,
                  "title": "How quickly will the bike be ready?",
                  "content": "It depends on the scope of the work and how busy we are at the time. When you drop the bike off we tell you roughly how long it will take. Smaller urgent repairs we can often turn around faster."
                },
                {
                  "__component": "blocks.accordion",
                  "id": 111,
                  "title": "Do I have to pay in advance?",
                  "content": "No. Payment is on collection of the bike. If more expensive spare parts are needed, we tell you the price in advance."
                },
                {
                  "__component": "blocks.accordion",
                  "id": 112,
                  "title": "Do you service e-bikes too?",
                  "content": "The mechanical side and drive-system diagnostics, yes. For batteries and motors we recommend the manufacturer's official service, except for the simpler jobs."
                }
              ]
